# Local game data path (example only)

Copy to `WOLF3D_DATA.local` (gitignored) or set the env var in your shell.

```bat
set WOLF3D_DATA=D:\wolf3d-master\Wolf3dgame
```

PowerShell:

```powershell
$env:WOLF3D_DATA = 'D:\wolf3d-master\Wolf3dgame'
```

Never commit real path files if they contain extraneous secrets; this folder name is not secret, but habits matter.
